e-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.2381%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.7619%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Quarter\">Magician Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Trade%20Quarter\">Trade Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Factory%20Quarter\">Factory Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20Evil\">Isle of Evil</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda%20Laboratory\">Tiquanda Laboratory</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt's similar to <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Apprentice\">Dark Apprentices</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Magician\">Dark Magicians</a>, however they're distance fighters. Additionally, it deals stronger magic damage.<br/><br/>A mad scientist attacks in melee range. A mad scientist never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKill it fast, as he will use his magical items to harm you. Use Death-based Runes or Spells. <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> &amp; <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> can kill these quickly with 65+ skills.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 34,362 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>